                <pb facs="1301" n="1143" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1143"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">decisions of the department of
                    fomento</hi>.</head>
                <p>Decisions of the department of fomento.—Mexico, December 15, 1905.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">To the first section:</hi></p>
                <p>Having received frequent complaints from foreigners established within the Free
                    Zone of Sonora, in that they do not enjoy any protection to devote themselves to
                    their labors, the President of the Republic has decided, that for the time being
                    foreigners shall not be permitted in the future to acquire any real estate in
                    said zone.</p>
                <closer><salute>Signed by the subsecretary.</salute></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
